{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58314\" variant=\"standard\">开头那一声低音沉沉落下，像一枚石子没入深水，留下的震动久久不散。随后，零零落落的声音向上探去，轻轻的，带着些许迟疑，仿佛一句话刚要说出口，又忽然停住。那一瞬间，心也跟着悬了起来，不知道该落向何处。直到柔和而均匀的摇荡渐渐浮现，才感到身体被水流轻轻托住。那并不是一下子到来的安宁，而像一口憋了很久的气，终于可以缓缓呼出。最初那声低音的重量仍留在耳边，脚下坚实的感觉却已悄悄退去。水面似乎还带着一丝凉意，轻微的起伏一下一下传来，心绪也随之松动。此刻还谈不上真正的平静，只觉得有什么正在慢慢远去，而自己正被一种陌生又温柔的力量带着，轻轻摇晃。</WritingBlock>", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-3ab8b05c353a4275adf6a3eeb6f8108f", "response_sha256": "d759605a3021757e30e771e1a5ed1f11f2b2214e62001a509c5d74acedb17f3e", "session_handle": "fa094c64-0c46-44a5-beef-b33f86593fca", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.936, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 7.054}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 192, "first_assistant_seconds": 27.703, "first_text_seconds": 27.891, "stream_seconds": 37.36, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 185}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_succes